  "body": "Part of #4245 (the CAM-first workspace plan), step 1, PR R. It comes first: PR E, P and K build on it.\n\n## What happens\n\n`crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs` has about 1665 lines. It holds the ribbon, the machine-mode tabs and the status bar. The AGENTS.md \"400-line files\" rule says to split such a file along the domain seam. Each later UI step (the menu bar, the folding panes, the kit) must change this file.\n\n## Expected\n\n- Split `panes.rs` into files for the ribbon, the machine-mode tabs and the status bar (and the rest where a clear seam is), each under about 400 lines.\n- No visible change: the same widgets, labels, roles, order and commands. No behaviour change.\n- Keep the public names that other modules and tests use, or update those users in this PR.\n\n## Done means\n\n- No file of the split is over about 400 lines.\n- All `crates/ui` tests pass unchanged, except for module paths. The `crates/ui` test count stays the same.\n- The layout and structural tests of the shell, the ribbon and the status bar pass unchanged.\n\nEffort: medium (a mechanical move with many users).\n",
